{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3ea18d54-8674-8237-a41b-e2a5ec790084",
  "created_at": "2026-03-03T11:52:59-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Omar Patel",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:46:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:46:23-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes. Good morning. My name is Omar Patel. I'm calling about a storm drain. A drain that is... frozen. Frozen shut."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:46:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Frozen shut, okay. Where is this, Mr. Patel?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:46:40-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at 450 Gibbs Avenue. The Ocean Drive side. The grate is at the corner there, right at the intersection."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:46:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 450 Gibbs. And what's it doing right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:46:56-05:00",
      "duration": 29,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The grate is iced over. Solid. And the water, it comes down from the street and it has nowhere to go, so it spreads. Right across the intersection. A big sheet of it. And it's not raining. It's not snowing. Nothing. It's dry out. It's just, the melt, and whatever runs off, and it sits."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:47:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, so it's a dry-weather thing, no storm. Just meltwater and it's not draining."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:47:33-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. No storm. And this is, um, the problem. It keeps happening. Every time it warms up a little and freezes again at night, the same thing. Same thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:47:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And it's across the whole intersection, you said?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:47:54-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Both ways. And then at night it freezes into ice. So now it's a skating rink. My mother's neighbor, he's older, he's, he's eighty-something, and he cannot get out. He won't walk through that. He can't drive out either, his car is right there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:48:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's not good. Is he okay? Does he need anything emergency-wise, like medical?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:48:26-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no. He's okay. He's just stuck. Stuck in the house. I'm calling for my mother, actually, she lives at that address and she's the one who sees it out the window. She asked me to call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:48:46-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'll put in a request for a crew to look at that grate and clear it. Has anybody reported it before that you know of?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:49:01-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I believe so. My mother said someone called, but I don't know who. So I want to ask you. When did they last come by? When was the last time a crew was there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:49:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me pull up that location. Hang on a second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:49:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:49:27-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm looking at it. I see a note on that corner. A crew went by and checked it, and the entry says ten fifteen on, um, the day it was logged."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:49:44-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ten fifteen. Or was it ten fifty? Can you check that? Ten fifteen or ten fifty?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:49:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, let me look again. It's ten fifteen. One-zero, one-five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:49:59-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ten fifteen. Okay. Because my mother says it was later. Closer to eleven. So maybe the crew came, looked, and left. And did nothing. Nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:50:13-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The note just says they checked it. It doesn't say they cleared it, so I can't tell you more than that from here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:50:26-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So they looked at it, and it's still frozen. That is... frustrating. I'm sorry, but it is. It has been like this for days. Days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:50:40-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I hear you. It's a fair thing to be frustrated about. I'm going to put this in as a new request with the ice and the water across the intersection and the neighbor who can't get out, so it's flagged properly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:51:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please. Please do that. Because if they come and only look, again, then we are right back here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:51:12-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll note that the grate is frozen shut and needs to be opened up, not just inspected. Can I get a number in case the crew needs to reach someone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:51:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It's four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-zero. That's my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:51:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-zero. Got it. And that's you, Omar Patel?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:51:40-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Patel. P-A-T-E-L."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:51:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. And the address again, just to be sure, is 450 Gibbs Avenue, Ocean Drive side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:51:51-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. The corner right by the house. You cannot miss it. It's the one with the big puddle. Well, the big sheet of ice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:52:04-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll make sure they know. Crews are pretty stretched this time of year, so I can't give you an hour, but this goes in marked as a hazard because of the ice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:52:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And if somebody falls, that's, that's on... well. I'm not going to say. I just want it fixed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:52:32-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep. If anyone does get hurt or it gets worse, call us right back, and if it's an emergency call 911."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:52:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you, Denise. I appreciate you taking the time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:52:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Patel. Tell your mom we're on it. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:52:57-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
